# The Relativistic Investigation Bureau — this repository tracks the
# manuscript (FINAL_REV10_The_Murder_That_Hadnt_Happened_Yet_KINDLE_READY.docx),
# its plain-text export, cover art, KDP metadata, the companion physics demo
# site, and project documentation.
#
# Deliberately excluded: the pre-git backup archive (bak/ — old revisions,
