# editing sessions (e.g. one-off Python helpers, repackaging steps) ---
__pycache__/
/_*.py
/_*.txt
*.docx.ready
*.docx.repack

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
~$*
*.tmp
